# Playwright E2E artifacts (generated by smoke.mjs / visual-diff.mjs)
# baseline.png IS committed (local same-platform pixel reference)
# layout-baseline.json IS committed (UI 结构门禁基线 —— CI 真正用的锚点）
# smoke.png / smoke.json / layout.json / layout-diff.json / diff.png are per-run, ignored
*.png
!baseline.png
*.json
!layout-baseline.json
!*.gitkeep
